  id: tur_5
  giverName: "K\xE2tip Nevin"
  giverPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0366aa63b404f6742aec29adebb7f8d1, type: 3}
  giverLines:
  - "Simyac\u0131lar Loncas\u0131 seni Tepkime T\xFCrleri s\u0131nav\u0131na \xE7a\u011F\u0131r\u0131r."
  - "D\xF6rt soru. Yanl\u0131\u015F yaz\u0131lan soru \xE7ekilir, yerine ba\u015Fkas\u0131
    gelir. M\xFCh\xFCr ancak hepsi do\u011Fruysa bas\u0131l\u0131r."
  deliveryLines:
  - "K\xE2tip Nevin s\u0131nav k\xE2\u011F\u0131d\u0131n\u0131 m\xFCh\xFCrledi: \"Lonca
    seni kayda ge\xE7irdi, \xE7\u0131rak.\""
  hintText: "Her soruda \xF6nce t\xFCr\xFC d\xFC\u015F\xFCn: birle\u015Fme mi, ayr\u0131\u015Fma
    m\u0131, oksijenle yanma m\u0131?"
  realLifeText: "Sindirim, paslanma, ekme\u011Fin kabarmas\u0131... \xC7evrendeki
    bir\xE7ok de\u011Fi\u015Fim bu tepkime t\xFCrlerinden biridir."
  wrapper: 3
  paperTitle: "Lonca S\u0131nav\u0131"
